⚙️ <b>Settings</b>
Alert thresholds and the daily digest:
<pre>CPU alert      90%
Memory alert   90%
Disk alert     85%
Temp alert     105°C
Battery alert  15%
Daily digest   off · 07:00</pre>
Alerts fire when a value crosses its threshold (battery: when below). Steps of 5.
--- keyboard ---
[🖥 CPU −5] → ~1th|cpu|85  [🖥 CPU 90%] → ~1th|cpu  [🖥 CPU +5] → ~1th|cpu|95
[🧠 Memory −5] → ~1th|mem|85  [🧠 Memory 90%] → ~1th|mem  [🧠 Memory +5] → ~1th|mem|95
[💾 Disk −5] → ~1th|disk|80  [💾 Disk 85%] → ~1th|disk  [💾 Disk +5] → ~1th|disk|90
[🌡 Temp −5] → ~1th|temp|100  [🌡 Temp 105°C] → ~1th|temp  [🌡 Temp +5] → ~1th|temp|105
[🔋 Battery −5] → ~1th|batt|10  [🔋 Battery 15%] → ~1th|batt  [🔋 Battery +5] → ~1th|batt|20
[📰 Digest: off] → ~1dg|on  [−1h] → ~1dh|6  [07:00] → ~1dh  [+1h] → ~1dh|8
[👁 Watching] → ~1v|wat  [⬇️ Update] → ~1v|upd  [🧹 Clear chat] → ~1cc
[❓ Help] → ~1v|hlp
[⬅️ Back] → ~1v|home  [🏠 Home] → ~1v|home  [🔄 Refresh] → ~1v|set
